{"seq":2,"slug":"progressive-delivery","title":"第 2 章：渐进式发布","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-flags-engineering","title":"Feature Flag 工程化管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/feature-flags-engineering","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"canary-bluegreen-deployment","title":"金丝雀与蓝绿部署的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/canary-bluegreen-deployment","wordCount":2119,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"traffic-shaping-rollout","title":"流量塑形与分级发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/release-engineering/progressive-delivery/traffic-shaping-rollout","wordCount":2098,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第-2-章-渐进式发布\">第 2 章：渐进式发布</h1><p>渐进式发布（Progressive Delivery）是持续交付的演进形态——不再将部署视为全量二元事件，而是通过精细的流量控制和实时反馈循环，将变更逐步推送给越来越多的用户。本章从三个维度拆解这一方法论的工程实现。</p>\n<p>第一篇聚焦 Feature Flag 的工程化管理——不只是&quot;开关&quot;那么简单，而是涉及分类、生命周期、技术债治理的完整体系。第二篇对比金丝雀与蓝绿两种经典部署模式的实现细节与适用场景。第三篇深入流量塑形与分级发布的具体操作——如何设计流量比例、如何定义扩量条件、如何处理有状态服务的灰度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"feature-flags-engineering\">Feature Flag 工程化</a></td>\n<td>分类体系、评估引擎、生命周期管理、技术债治理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"canary-bluegreen-deployment\">金丝雀与蓝绿部署</a></td>\n<td>两种模式对比、架构实现、指标验证、回滚机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"traffic-shaping-rollout\">流量塑形与分级发布</a></td>\n<td>流量切分策略、扩量规则、有状态服务灰度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}